post_install() {
    cat <<EOF

==> IMPORTANT NOTICE
==> ==================
Please be aware that the Wavelog team officially recommends installing via
Docker rather than performing a direct system installation.

This AUR package is community-maintained and is not supported by the official
team; users must resolve any issues on their own should they arise.

For Docker installation instructions, please refer to the official guide:
https://github.com/wavelog/wavelog/wiki/Installation

==> Installation Instructions
==> ==========================
For detailed installation and configuration instructions, please see:
/usr/share/doc/wavelog/README.md

Quick start:
1. Set up database (MySQL/MariaDB)
2. Configure web server (Apache/Nginx)
3. Enable required PHP extensions (mysqli, gd)
4. Visit http://localhost/wavelog to complete installation

EOF
}

